            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court granted certiorari to determine whether H. B. 1181's age\u2011verification requirement is likely constitutional on its face."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5c2805a93c6082b67e99b64b0f3ebc8e58a79a3a0eb67fa066bb84274381910a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5c2805a93c60-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The central question before the Court was whether H. B. 1181's age\u2011verification requirement complies with the First Amendment."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background & Question",
